::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}
![](L02-conditional-probability_files/figure-revealjs/cell-10-output-1.png){width=1467 height=154}
:::
:::


[Proof: check the three axioms one by one. See the book, Section 2.1.]{.muted}

## Pitfall: the complement goes in front of the bar [Sec 2.1]{.tag}

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="45%"}

::: {#c2c2b921 .cell fig-height='3.1' fig-width='4.6' execution_count=10}

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}
![](L02-conditional-probability_files/figure-revealjs/cell-11-output-1.png){width=656 height=431}
:::
